@startuml
title Hybrid Recommendation Module : View Recommended Destination Details

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":recommendationDetails"
participant Ctrl as ":recommendationController"
participant Maps as ":serpApiGoogleMapsAPI"

Actor -> UI: Select Recommended Destination
UI -> Ctrl: Request Recommended Destination Details
Ctrl -> Maps: retrieveDestinationDetails(destinationId)
Maps --> Ctrl: Destination Details
alt [Details available]
  Ctrl --> UI: Display Recommended Destination Details
  alt [Ratings and reviews requested]
    Ctrl -> Maps: retrieveRatingsAndReviews(destinationId)
    Maps --> Ctrl: Ratings And Reviews
    Ctrl --> UI: Display Ratings And Reviews
  else [No additional review request]
    UI --> Actor: Keep Destination Details Visible
  end
else [Details unavailable]
  Ctrl --> UI: Display Recommendation Details Unavailable
end

@enduml
